   "id": 631673,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "A pool is filled with 15,000 gallons of water. It loses 200 gallons per day. How many days, <span data-math=\"d\">d</span>, have passed when the pool has&nbsp;<span data-math=\"g\">g</span> gallons of water?",
